# LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says (Windows CI turns it
# on). Sources, tests and samples are compared byte for byte, and Kotlin raw strings would pick
# up \r. The app itself reads CRLF files fine (LineEnding); this is only about the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe needs CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
